WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.780
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.760
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.560
Welcome to another episode of Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:06.680
This is a series

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.340
Where YOU challenge US

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.620
With your craziest ideas related to table tennis

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.420
If you idea gets picked, we will feature it and give you a shout out.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.440
So make sure to leave your ideas

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.680
In the comments below!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.840
We are going to find out if it's possible to
return Otto's around the net shots

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.260
Let's see how many we can return out of 10!

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.840
Can I do the magic?

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.980
Ooh, you can!

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.540
Now I have the right touch!

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.320
See! It's 1 out of 1!

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.760
Two out of two!

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.900
This is going well!

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.160
Okay that was a roller...

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.220
This challenge is from Anton779

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.880
He wants us to reach 200k subscribers

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:18.100
By the end of this year

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.360
Since a lot of you guys are not subscribers yet

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:21.740
Remember to do that!

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:24.580
So, Emil got 4.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.200
I'm going to do 5 - at least!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.840
Broken ball - does NOT count!

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:57.100
Aah, that was easy!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:02.740
With the hand

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.920
Muhammed Shaheer wants us to play a rally

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.260
While running 5 laps around the table.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:22.440
Almost!

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.100
You gotta run faster!

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.220
I will show it's done!

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:28.240
Let the sensei show it's done!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.780
Okay this is not going to work!

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.800
Ok, Miikka can continue!

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.080
It's looking good!

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.080
That's four, one more!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.140
You made it!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:17.940
Was it tough?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:19.940
No, it was easy!

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.820
Luckily I got it on the first try!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.040
Luckily yeah!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.120
Specle Josh wants us to do 20
shots in 10 seconds

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:42.380
Could be!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.060
That was 10 seconds, yeah!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:45.960
Thanks for watching guys!

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.480
Hope you enjoyed this episode

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.780
If you liked it, give it a thumbs up

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.880
Subscribe right here

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:53.100
And watch our previous episodes here

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.100
Until next time!

